    email: "ganshiwakoti@gmail.com"
  - family-names: "Arockiaraj"
    given-names: "Michael"
    affiliation: "Department of Mathematics, Loyola College, Chennai"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Singati2/topological-index-orthogonality"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - "topological indices"
  - "QSPR"
  - "orthogonality screening"
  - "bond-incident-degree"
  - "Wuzi index family"
  - "cheminformatics"
abstract: >-
  Companion software for two manuscripts. Paper 1: the Wuzi parametric
  topological-index family with closed forms on standard graph classes,
  a ratio-bound theorem with respect to classical BID indices, a
  computational extremal-tree study, and a sensitivity analysis on the
  18 octane / 106 decane / 75 decane-isomer benchmarks. Paper 2: an
  open-source orthogonality-screening pipeline (pairwise correlation,
  PCA effective rank, partial correlation, VIF, combined criterion)
  applied to a 30-index classical baseline on ESOL, FreeSolv,
  Lipophilicity, and BBBP, with a 5-fold cross-validated RandomForest
  benchmark.
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-05-20"
